Package: sessionintent
Architecture: all
Depends: ${python3:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, python3-yaml
Recommends: wofi | rofi, wmctrl, xdotool
Description: declarative session orchestration for Linux desktops
 SessionIntent switches between intent-based modes (work, gaming,
 browsing) that launch, reuse, and organize applications across
 workspaces. Backends are auto-detected: GNOME, KDE Plasma, Hyprland,
 Sway, generic wlroots, and an EWMH fallback.
